Subject: [flux] Build //chrome/browser/flux into the browser

Adds the Flux agent layer as a dependency of the browser target so it is
linked into chrome. The module itself lives outside the Chromium tree and is
symlinked in by build/sync.sh.

diff --git a/chrome/browser/BUILD.gn b/chrome/browser/BUILD.gn
--- a/chrome/browser/BUILD.gn
+++ b/chrome/browser/BUILD.gn
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@ static_library("browser") {
   deps = [
+    "//chrome/browser/flux",
     "//chrome/browser/profiles",
     "//chrome/browser/ui",
   ]
